        "x1": 162.5,
        "tag": "title",
        "text": "A Technology"
      },
      {
        "y": 88.4,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 360.1,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "Here are some things we are likely to see more of in the future."
      },
      {
        "y": 107.1,
        "x0": 103.5,
        "x1": 496.2,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "smart buildings/homes computer-controlled buildings and homes where things like lighting, heating,"
      },
      {
        "y": 117.9,
        "x0": 206.2,
        "x1": 489.5,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "security, etc. are completely automatic; the adjective smart can be used for"
      },
      {
        "y": 129.2,
        "x0": 206.2,
        "x1": 493.7,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "anything that uses computers or information stored in electronic form (e.g. a"
      },
      {
        "y": 140.2,
        "x0": 206.2,
        "x1": 331.8,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "smartphone, smart TV, smart car)"
      },
      {
        "y": 154.8,
        "x0": 103.5,
        "x1": 459.7,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "interplanetary travel travel to planets in outer space, either for exploration or for tourism"
      },
      {
        "y": 165.8,
        "x0": 103.5,
        "x1": 174.1,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "and space tourism"
      },
      {
        "y": 180.6,
        "x0": 103.5,
        "x1": 492.6,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "nanotechnology science of developing and producing extremely small tools and machines by"
      },
      {
        "y": 191.7,
        "x0": 206.2,
        "x1": 404.2,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "controlling the arrangement of atoms and molecules"
      },
      {
        "y": 206.3,
        "x0": 103.5,
        "x1": 508.3,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "keyhole surgery medical operation in which a very small hole is made in a person’s body to reach"
      },
      {
        "y": 217.5,
        "x0": 206.2,
        "x1": 301,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "the organ or tissue inside"
      },
      {
        "y": 240.5,
        "x0": 74.7,
        "x1": 257.3,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "B The environment and nature"
      },
      {
        "y": 258,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 519.9,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "A doomsday scenario for the environment sees our destiny as a world choked with pollution, where"
      },
      {
        "y": 270.5,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 502.5,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "many plants and animals have become extinct. [the worst possible prediction, what will happen in the"
      },
      {
        "y": 283.4,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 302.4,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "future] [the things that will happen to us in the future]"
      },
      {
        "y": 294,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 494.4,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "Many experts foresee a situation where traffic in mega-cities becomes completely gridlocked."
      },
      {
        "y": 307.4,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 502.2,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "[think that something will occur in the future] [cities of more than 10 million people] [unable to move at all]"
      },
      {
        "y": 318,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 490.7,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "The population explosion may lead to widespread food and water shortages. [rapid increase in"
      },
      {
        "y": 331.4,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 143.5,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "population]"
      },
      {
        "y": 342,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 492.4,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "Genetic modification/engineering is already used to change fruit and vegetables so that they"
      },
      {
        "y": 354,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 512,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "grow better. However, many people object to the idea of genetically modified (or GM) food/crops."
      },
      {
        "y": 367.4,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 396.5,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "[changing genes] [food/crops created by changing the genes of the ingredients]"
      },
      {
        "y": 378,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 494.2,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "Gene therapy will be used to eradicate some diseases, thanks to our knowledge of the human"
      },
      {
        "y": 390,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 499.8,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "genome. [changing genes in order to prevent disease or disability] [the ‘map’ or index of all the genes in a"
      },
      {
        "y": 403.4,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 151.9,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "human being]"
      },
      {
        "y": 414,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 508.5,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "Some people envisage a world in which designer babies will be popular. [see a possible or probable"
      },
      {
        "y": 427.4,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 412,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "situation in the future] [babies whose genetic characteristics are artificially created]"
      },
      {
        "y": 438,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 519.7,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "Cloning of animals, and even human beings, may become common. [making a genetically identical copy]"
      },
      {
        "y": 459.4,
        "x0": 75,
        "x1": 204.2,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "C Society and people"
      },
      {
        "y": 487.2,
        "x0": 108.7,
        "x1": 476.3,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "The breakdown of the traditional family structure has already occurred in some countries. In"
      },
      {
        "y": 499.2,
        "x0": 108.7,
        "x1": 502.8,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "future, the nuclear family1 may no longer be the main type of family unit, and more loosely defined"
      },
      {
        "y": 511.2,
        "x0": 108.7,
        "x1": 505.4,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "relationships will develop. Globalisation2 will increase, affecting how things are produced and sold,"
      },
      {
        "y": 523.2,
        "x0": 108.7,
        "x1": 501.2,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "what we buy and how we communicate. The world has become a global village3 and we will have"
      },
      {
        "y": 535.2,
        "x0": 108.7,
        "x1": 490.3,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "more and more contact with other people in it. We may even make contact with extraterrestrial"
      },
      {
        "y": 547.2,
        "x0": 108.7,
        "x1": 493.5,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "beings4. The gulf5 between rich and poor nations will widen if we do not take drastic measures6"
      },
      {
        "y": 559.2,
        "x0": 108.7,
        "x1": 225.4,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "now to improve the situation."
      },
      {
        "y": 583.5,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 293.2,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "1 family with father, mother and one or two children"
